<title>USA: Dell Computer sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Dell Computer sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>AUSTIN, Texas 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dell Computer Corp on Tuesday said it approved a two-for-one stock split payable on December 6 to stockholders of record on November 25.</p>
<p>At the end of its most recent fiscal quarter, ended October 27, Dell had 94 million shares issued. Some six million were held by the company as treasury shares.</p>
<p>The stock split will be Dell's third in the last five years, the firm said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk +1 212 859 1610</p>
</text>
